OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient hit with #680 in
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man having cancer treatment says he
OL,7,Fis being chased by debt collectors
OL,8,Fafter running up #680 in charges while
OL,9,Fattending hospital appointments.
OL,11,FJeremy Whaley, 76, from Alton,
OL,12,FHampshire, received four parking
OL,13,Fnotices at Queen Alexandra Hospital in
OL,14,FPortsmouth after his free exemption
OL,15,Fexpired.
OL,17,FParking firm Parkshield rejected his
OL,18,Fappeal and added more fees, but the
OL,19,Fhospital trust said it had now asked
OL,20,Ffor all the charges to be cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
