OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also said it was sorry Whaley "felt
OL,7,Fthe process was not as clear as it
OL,8,Fshould have been", while Parkshield
OL,9,Fsaid it always cancelled charges when
OL,10,Fgiven a valid exemption certificate.
